## The bigger picture

We are building **xal**, a catalogue of reusable, independently versioned business
microservices. On top sit a **service registry**, a **composition frontend**, and later an
**AI layer** that composes solutions from plain English. Composability depends on every
service exposing a **stable contract** with configurable variation behind it.

> **LANGUAGE IS AN IMPLEMENTATION DETAIL BEHIND A STANDARD PLATFORM CONTRACT.**
