## Lessons & continuous improvement (standing directive)

At the end of every session, before the handoff, review what happened and identify any
pitfall, workaround, repeated explanation, or consequential decision. For each, propose its
home: a **script** (mechanical task), a **skill/command** (recurring procedure), a **CLAUDE.md
guardrail** (always-true rule), or an **ADR** (architectural decision). Append unresolved
items to `docs/lessons.md`; never let a temporary workaround outlive its session without a
tracked task to remove it. The `/wrap-session` ritual automates this; durable concept notes
live under `docs/concepts/` (the `concept-note` skill).
